sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    Client ->> Backend: POST /api/planner/generate (Request Preferences)
    Backend ->> Database: Query place candidates in city (smartFilter)
    Database -->> Backend: Return places list
    alt RAG Enrichment & OpenRouter Call
        Backend ->> OpenRouter API: POST /chat/completions (RAG prompt context)
        OpenRouter API -->> Backend: Return AI Itinerary JSON
    else AI Fallback Logic (if OpenRouter fails/disabled)
        Backend ->> Backend: Proximity Clustering & Local Scheduling
    end
    Backend -->> Client: Return 200 OK (Itinerary JSON Payload)
